classTweaker v1 official
# Fabric/Loom ClassTweaker (supersedes access wideners) — the equivalent of the old
# META-INF/accesstransformer.cfg (which Fabric ignores). Entries are added back per-subsystem as
# the code that needs them is ported, each re-verified against MC 26.1.2 with the field/method
# descriptor the AT format omits. Pending conversions from accesstransformer.cfg:
#   RecipeManager.recipes / .byName                         (registries / recipes)
#   LootPool.Builder.entries / .conditions / .functions     (loot)
#   StateHolder.instance, StateDefinition.owner             (block/state registration)
#   Screen.font                                             (client tooltips)

# === util (PlaceboUtil.registerCustomColor / Placebo.java NAMED_COLORS reassignment) ===
# registerCustomColor reads TextColor.NAMED_COLORS and calls .put(); Placebo.onInitialize replaces the vanilla
# immutable Map.copyOf with a mutable HashMap copy, which requires the field to be both accessible and non-final.
