# === menu (PlaceboContainerMenu) ===
# PlaceboContainerMenu#setData overrides AbstractContainerMenu#setData to additionally notify the menu's
# ContainerListeners (so IDataUpdateListener.dataUpdated fires client-side when a ClientboundContainerSetDataPacket
# arrives). Vanilla's setData only mutates the DataSlot; the listener-notify pass lives in the private
# updateDataSlotListeners(int, int). NeoForge patched it accessible; here we widen it 1:1. Descriptor (II)V.
accessible method net/minecraft/world/inventory/AbstractContainerMenu updateDataSlotListeners (II)V

